### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# The whole of it, and the run configurations with it. None of it is the program: Gradle drives the
# build, and IntelliJ regenerates every one of these files when the project is imported. Several of
# them also describe this machine rather than the project — misc.xml names the SDK `corretto-11`,
# which is neither present on a clone nor the version the toolchain in build.gradle.kts asks for.
.idea/
.run/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/

### Kotlin ###
.kotlin

