### Local development state — never publish ###
# The whole folder: the tooling setup this is developed with is not part of the program. Its
# settings.local.json records absolute paths under the developer's home directory and past session
# identifiers, and the agent definitions beside it are a working arrangement rather than something a
# contributor needs. CLAUDE.md at the root is deliberately *not* covered by this — it documents the
# code and is meant to be read.
.claude/
.mcp.json

# The troubleshooting log, when it is switched on. It normally lands in the settings folder rather
# than here, but --selftest run from the project root can put one in the working directory.
logs/
*.log

# JVM heap dumps. They land beside whatever produced them and are hundreds of megabytes.
# hs_err_pid*.log is already covered by *.log above.
*.hprof

# Audio assets, which this project never ships: a NAM capture, an impulse response and a recording
# all carry someone's copyright, and the program loads them from wherever the user keeps them. The
# recorder writes to the home folder by default, but its destination is settable to anywhere — so
# this is the guard that stops `git add -A` from ever committing one.
*.nam
*.wav
*.ir

### Kept on disk, kept out of the repository ###
# Superseded icon drafts. The two the program actually loads are omega_icon_v6.svg and
# omega_icon_v6_small.svg (see ui/AppIcon.kt); these are the versions they came from.
/guitar_gauge_icon_no_screen_v5.svg
/guitar_gauge_icon_themed_v4.png
/guitar_gauge_icon_themed_v4.svg